configure
ip routing
interface Ethernet1
description A to-cjunosevolved
no switchport
ip address 10.0.12.0/31
ip ospf network point-to-point
ip ospf area 0.0.0.0
interface Ethernet2
description A to-xrv9k
no switchport
ip address 10.0.41.1/31
ip ospf network point-to-point
ip ospf area 0.0.0.0
interface Loopback0
description A loopback
ip address 10.255.0.1/32
ip ospf area 0.0.0.0
router ospf 1
router-id 10.255.0.1
passive-interface Loopback0
ip prefix-list RESTORE-A seq 10 permit 10.255.0.0/24 le 32
ip route 192.0.2.1/32 Null0
end
write memory
